22/May/26 4:11 PM;712020:1850c942-d5a0-4671-b013-9d14cc099bf6;note : In following request gscid field must send Request:

url : {{http://192.168.209.187:3333/ProxyWebsocket}}

method : Post

{ "request": { "data": { "gscid": "ABCD" }, "response_format": "json", "request_type": "subscribe", "streaming_type": "ProxyWebsocket" } }

Response: case 1: if provided gscid is connected to websocket following response will get

{ErrorCode":0, "message":"success"}

case 2: if provided gscid is not connected to websocket following response will get {"ErrorCode":3,"message":"not_connected"}

