column41:
The client has provided a new SMS API along with its documentation for IBT 2FA OTP functionality implementation.

Earlier, OTP SMS services were being used through the Theitmatic vendor. Due to some issues with the existing vendor, the client has now shared a new SMS API from the Airtel vendor for OTP delivery.

The provided API and configuration details need to be integrated and tested for IBT 2FA OTP functionality.

The API documentation file has been attached to this ticket for reference.

----

*Existing Mail Credentials & Configuration Details:*

h3. Vendor: Theitmatic

* URL: {{https://emailtheitmatic.1ds.in/}}
* User: {{indirasecurities}}
* Registered Email ID: {{vramavat@indiratrade.com}}
* Registered Mobile No.: {{9301102299}}
* Sender Email ID: {{noreply@indiratrade.com}}

----

h3. Vendor: Netgain

* SMTP Server: {{180.179.151.1}}
* Incoming Server: {{secure.netgains.in}}
* Outgoing Server: {{secure.netgains.in}}
* IMAP Port: {{143}}
* POP Port: {{110}}
* SMTP Port: {{25 / 587}}
* Security: {{None}}
* Username: {{indiratradetx@m3c.io}}
* Password: {{7q333B4|7n=5I1B}}



[^Airtel IQ -WhatsApp API Documentation 1.pdf] [^SMS API Deck Airtel IQ.pdf]

