column495:
30/Jan/26 3:34 PM;63e9c4d89e626e54cc5aa326;{quote}*Issue Description:*
When the Receiver thread runs at *100% CPU usage (without sleep)*, TCP/IP disconnections or related errors are not detected properly.{quote}

{quote}*Solution:*
Introduced proper handling for TCP/IP error scenarios. This ensures TCP/IP disconnections and related errors are detected correctly and corresponding entries are written to the log file.{quote}

column41:
1.Login to 2,3 client on same server.(Sayali,Sayali11,Hanu123).
[2.Do|http://2.Do] some trades with PRO and some with retailers.
3.Save client side database(Ctrl+Shift+z) from dealer SAYALI.
4.Open that database-> tradeinfo table.
5.You will see that,in saved database's tradeinfo table all 3 dealer's trade get inserted.
6.Now,login any new dealer with no [trades.Do|http://trades.Do] Ctrl+Shift+z ad save database.
7.Open that saved database,you will see that  in database-> tradeinfo table,all dealers trades get display.

Observation:1.If we save database of 'SAYALI',all trades(pro+cli) get inserted.But other dealers(Sayali11's)only retailer's trades get inserted.
Due to this,in Online and Generic backup also,all dealer's trade get print.
{color:#ff5630}*2.On server "RouteResponseToAllDealer=true" and View order functionality is disabled for retailers.*{color}
3.Incase of "RouteResponseToAllDealer=false",then only that specific dealer's trade get inserted in database.

Recording,Screenshots and client side database are provide on below link:

[ftp://192.168.209.145/SayaliK/Other dealers trades get display with route response_0601/|ftp://192.168.209.145/SayaliK/Other%20dealers%20trades%20get%20display%20with%20route%20response_0601/]





{color:#6554c0}+*Developer Comment:*+{color}

{color:#6554c0}We did changes and taken precautions in backup functionality and solved backup issue {color}[https://greeksoft-technologies.atlassian.net/browse/GETSCTCL-9812|https://greeksoft-technologies.atlassian.net/browse/GETSCTCL-9812|smart-link]{color:#6554c0} {color}

{color:#6554c0}But main issue is TradeInfo table contains all dealer trades is not solved…{color}

{color:#6554c0}Regards,{color}

{color:#6554c0}Bhushan R Chaudhari{color}

