column41:
1.Login CTCL Client & Greek.
2.Add multiple weekly & monthly expiry option,future tokens on greek marketwach.
3.observe left day's on grek marketwach.
Obseration: you will observe that, Left Day's Display wrong in greek marketwach.


Note: As per observation Issue Face with Near,FAR Date Diff & include,Exclude expiry Diff.



h3. 

h3. {color:#0747a6}+*Developer Comment:*+{color}

h3. {color:#0747a6}This is not an issue,{color}

h3. {color:#0747a6}Please verify the date on CTCLManager system{color}

h3. {color:#0747a6}You can verify the server date from the date on title bar of CTCLClient{color}

h3. {color:#0747a6}Once you correct the system date on server or you login any exchange, date will synchronize automatically…{color}

h3. {color:#0747a6}Regards,{color}

