{"response":{"appID":"bc90bb525bc9739a9595bb9e176dab17","data":{"response":{"data":{"message":"Successfully Modify Password for User SANKET "}}},"infoID":"0"}}


Note - Data get updated in DB & it is working fine, issue only Response display on Postman

1.Login to the CTCL Client.
2.Login to Greek and create online/manual Greek positions.
3.Relogin the client (with or without Database, Downloading, and Broadcast tables).
4.Observe the Greek positions on the Greek Market Watch.
Observation: You will observe that, Greekpositions disappear from greek marketwach on client relogin even though positions are present in database.



